  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The equation <math alttext=\"12 t plus b equals c\"><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi></math> relates the variables <math alttext=\"t\"><mi>t</mi>\n</math>, <math alttext=\"b\"><mi>b</mi>\n</math>, and <math alttext=\"c\"><mi>c</mi>\n</math>. Which of the following correctly expresses the value of <math alttext=\"c minus b\"><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></math> in terms of <math alttext=\"t\"><mi>t</mi>\n</math>?</p>",
